<title>POLAND: KETY MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>KETY MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.82 vs   2.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.83 vs   4.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.22 vs   4.00</p>
<p> Sales		   35.65 vs  31.01</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.26 vs   8.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.52 vs  13.92</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.00 vs  12.33</p>
<p> Sales		  101.87 vs  91.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish aluminium plant is Zaklady</p>
<p>Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
